OL,3,ACate Blanchett asks theatre audience to
OL,4,Astop filming during show
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I understand you like filming the
OL,7,Fcurtain call ` and it is kind of
OL,8,Fflattering in a way ` but for anyone
OL,9,Fwho is filming the show, please don't,
OL,10,Fbecause it spoils it for the next group
OL,11,Fof people who come in and are present
OL,12,Fwith us. So thank you very much."
